<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD XI V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD XI V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>PATIALA, India 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the final day</p>
<p>of the three-day match between the Indian Board President's XI</p>
<p>and Australia on Monday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 358-8 declared (M.Beven 100 not out,</p>
<p>R.Ponting 58, M.Slater 56; D.Ganesh 5-103)</p>
<p>Indian Board President's XI first innings (overnight 85-2)</p>
<p> V.Rathore c Taylor b Reiffel     15</p>
<p> S.Manjrekar lbw b Reiffel	  20</p>
<p> V.Laxman c and b M.Waugh	   36</p>
<p> P.Dharmani not out		  130</p>
<p> S.Karim c Healy b M.Waugh	   3</p>
<p> S.Joshi c Bevan b M.Waugh	   7</p>
<p> A.Kapoor c Taylor b M.Waugh	 5</p>
<p> V.Kambli c Taylor b McIntyre	9</p>
<p> D.Johnson c Bevan b McIntyre	1</p>
<p> D.Ganesh c McIntyre b M.Waugh    15</p>
<p> N.Hirwani c Fleming b M.Waugh     6</p>
<p> Extras (b-3 lb-5 nb-7)	     15</p>
<p> Total				   262</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-32 2-47 3-153 4-178 5-202 6-212 7-225</p>
<p>8-233 9-254</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 17-5-34-0 (4nb), Fleming 11-0-39-0, Reiffel</p>
<p>13-4-38-2 (2nb), McIntyre 21-7-62-2 (1nb), Bevan 1-0-13-0,</p>
<p>M.Waugh 16.5-3-68-6</p>
<p>Australia second innings</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Joshi b Kapoor	  41</p>
<p> M.Slater lbw b Johnson		2</p>
<p> R.Ponting not out		    37</p>
<p> M.Waugh not out			17</p>
<p> Extras (lb-2)			   2</p>
<p> Total (2 wickets)		    99</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-17 2-67</p>
<p>Bowling: Johnson 10-0-23-1, Ganesh 11-1-40-0, Kapoor</p>
<p>7-1-24-1, Laxman 3-0-8-0, Dharmani 1-0-2-0</p>
<p>Result: match drawn.</p>
